fb284773839fa0e914736abb16babecd828c484058d56441f522135","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1971-01-16/pdf/FR-1971-01-16.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11578#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 2. Jurisdiction of the Commission.  It is hereby determined  \nthat the jurisdiction of the Ohio River Basin Commission referred to in  \nsection 1  of this order shall extend to those portions of the States of Ken­\ntucky, Illinois, Indiana, Maryland, N ew  York, North Carolina, Ohio,  \nPennsylvania, Tennessee, Virginia, and West Virginia that are located  \n.within the Ohio River drainage basin, excluding the Tennessee River  \ndrainage basin.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"36 FR 683, PDF pages 7-8; Sec. 2","sha256":"a7ccf8ba0fb284773839fa0e914736abb16babecd828c484058d56441f522135","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1971-01-16/pdf/FR-1971-01-16.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11578#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 3. Membership of the Commission.  It is hereby determined that,  \nin accordance with section 202 of the Act (42 U .S.C . 1962b— 1  ), the  \nCommission shall consist of the following members:\n( 1  ) a Chairman to be appointed by the President,\n(2 ) one member from each of the following Federal departments and  \nagencies :  Department of Agriculture, Department of the Army, Depart­\nment of Commerce, Department of Health, Education, and Welfare,  \nDepartment of Housing and Urban Development, Department of the  \nInterior, Department of Transportation, Federal Power Commission,  \nAtomic Energy Commission, and the Environmental Protection Agency,\nFEDERAL REGISTER, VOL. 36, NO. 11— SATURDAY, JANUARY 16, 1971\n\n=== PDF page 8 of 144 ===\n684 THE PRESIDENT\nsuch member to be appointed by the head of the department or inde­\npendent agency he represents,\n(3 ) one member from each of the following States: Kentucky, Illi­\nnois, Indiana, Maryland, N ew  York, North Carolina, Ohio, Pennsyl­\nvania, Tennessee, and West Virginia, and a member from Virginia when  \nauthorized by the legislature of that State, and\n(4 ) one member from each interstate agency created by an inter­\nstate compact to which the consent of Congress has been given and  \nwhose jurisdiction extends to the waters of the area specified in section 2.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"36 FR 683, PDF pages 7-8; Sec. 3","sha256":"a7ccf8ba0fb284773839fa0e914736abb16babecd828c484058d56441f522135","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1971-01-16/pdf/FR-1971-01-16.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11578#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec . 4. Functions, Powers, and Duties.  T he Commission and its  \nofficers, members, and employees shall perform and exercise, with respect  \nto the area specified in section 2 of this order, their respective functions,  \npowers, and duties as set out in Title II of the Water Resources Planning  \nAct.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"36 FR 683, PDF pages 7-8; Sec. 4","sha256":"a7ccf8ba0fb284773839fa0e914736abb16babecd828c484058d56441f522135","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1971-01-16/pdf/FR-1971-01-16.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11578#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 5. Reporting to the President.  The Chairman of the Commis­\nsion shall report to the President through the Water Resources Council.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"36 FR 683, PDF pages 7-8; Sec. 5","sha256":"a7ccf8ba0fb284773839fa0e914736abb16babecd828c484058d56441f522135","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1971-01-16/pdf/FR-1971-01-16.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11578#sec5","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"36 FR 683, PDF pages 7-8","sha256":"a7ccf8ba0fb284773839fa0e914736abb16babecd828c484058d56441f522135","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1971-01-16/pdf/FR-1971-01-16.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 5 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"no"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:11578"}
